From 0fa5bbe626531d8a60a4ea2a3da1787dfe3fe244 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:29:40 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Record the change history of events

New event_changes table (ON DELETE CASCADE on event_id) and EventChange
model. Event::saveWithHistory() reloads the stored event once, compares
every column (except user_id) with normalized values and writes one row
per changed field, authored by the session user. The admin show lists
the history newest first (created_at DESC, id DESC). Populate seeds one
example edit with two rows.
